-/-- The factors of `P_n` satisfy `|f'(f^k(z))/f'(p) - 1| ≤ A c_max^k` on `B_ε`. -/
-private theorem exists_norm_ratio_sub_one_le : ∃ A, 0 ≤ A ∧ ∀ k, ∀ z ∈ nbhd ε,
